      "sourceTextSha256": "9ce62d179c33fe88d1578cdb5dcfd10eef5a4154e5f8917823152d6fe1e4c32a",
      "text": "Over 18 days, this journey brings together very different parts of Peru and Bolivia. Begin in Lima with its colonial centre, Miraflores, the Larco Museum and contemporary cuisine. Then head to the Amazon for four days aboard Aria Amazon. From the jungle, travel up into the Andes to Cusco, the Sacred Valley and Machu Picchu, continue to Lake Titicaca, and cross into Bolivia for the Uyuni Salt Flat and an optional visit to the Altiplano lagoons.",
